  "headline": "Lansoprazole is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; current supply shows 19 days on hand at Corvale East and 27.7 days at Corvale General",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show lansoprazole is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 182 capsules of lansoprazole 30 mg at 9.6 a day, providing 19 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 255 capsules of lansoprazole 30 mg at 9.2 a day, providing 27.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label for NDC 50090518000 names A-S Medication Solutions as the product labeler and plant, with operations RELABEL and REPACK at a registered plant (FEI 1450743) last inspected VAI on 2026-08-12.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1331612 at that plant (FEI 1450743) ended 2026-08-12 with classification VAI, known to FDA on 2026-10-14.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to A-S Medication Solutions LLC (FEI 1450743) on 2017-06-05.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Camber Pharmaceuticals, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and uses Hetero Labs Limited Unit III (last inspection VAI 2023-07-21).",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
